WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:02.800
A ray starts at a point and goes on and on.

2
00:02.800 --> 00:05.100
Two rays meet at one point. That point is the vertex.

3
00:05.100 --> 00:07.700
The opening between the rays is the angle.

4
00:07.700 --> 00:10.900
Open the rays wider. The angle gets bigger.

5
00:10.900 --> 00:14.700
Close them a little. The angle gets smaller.

6
00:14.700 --> 00:17.900
The angle is the space between the rays.
